---
import { Picture } from "astro:assets";
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import SiteHeader from "../../../components/SiteHeader.astro";
import SiteFooter from "../../../components/SiteFooter.astro";
import { company } from "../../../data/site";
import constructionPhoto from "../../../../../../images/catalogue/instalacoes-embutidas-construcao.webp";
import facilitiesPhoto from "../../../../../../images/catalogue/caixilharia-vidro-fumado.webp";
import supplyPhoto from "../../../../../../images/catalogue/perfis-metalicos-estrutura.webp";
import "../../../styles/business-areas.css";
---
<BaseLayout title="Business Areas | HMATIAS — Angola" description="Explore HMATIAS business areas: construction and remodelling, facilities and maintenance, supply and procurement, and administrative and business support in Angola." lang="en">
  <div class="preview-bar"><span><i aria-hidden="true"></i> HMATIAS · BUSINESS AREAS</span><span>FOUR AREAS · ONE POINT OF CONTACT</span></div>
  <SiteHeader />
  <main class="business-areas-page">
    <section class="areas-hero" aria-labelledby="areas-title">
      <div class="areas-hero-copy"><nav class="areas-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/en/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Business Areas</span></nav><p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> HMATIAS CAPABILITIES · ANGOLA</p><h1 id="areas-title">Four areas.<br /><em>One integrated response.</em></h1><p class="areas-lead">HMATIAS supports companies, institutions and private clients with construction, facility operations, sourcing and supply, and administrative organisation.</p><div class="areas-actions"><a class="button button-light" href="#areas">Explore business areas <span>↓</span></a><a class="text-link text-link-light" href="/en/company-brochure/">Open company brochure <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="areas-meta"><span>{company.legalName}</span><span>Viana · Luanda · Angola</span></div></div>
      <aside class="areas-index"><span class="areas-index-label">OPERATIONAL AREAS</span><ol><li><span>01</span> Construction and remodelling</li><li><span>02</span> Facilities and maintenance</li><li><span>03</span> Supply and procurement</li><li><span>04</span> Business Services</li></ol><small>Each requirement is assessed before a proposal is prepared.</small></aside>
    </section>
    <section class="areas-intro section-pad"><p class="section-kicker">01 / SERVICE STRUCTURE</p><div class="areas-intro-content"><h2>Organised capabilities<br /><em>around your requirement.</em></h2><div><p>HMATIAS business areas make it easier to understand each requirement and direct it to the relevant service and process.</p><p>Scope, quantities, location, deliverables, timing and commercial conditions are clarified before any commitment is made.</p></div></div></section>
    <section class="areas-grid-section section-pad" id="areas"><div class="areas-heading"><div><p class="section-kicker">02 / BUSINESS AREAS</p><h2>Four delivery areas.<br /><em>One clear process.</em></h2></div><p>Review each area and open its dedicated service page.</p></div>
      <div class="areas-grid">
        <article class="area-card"><figure class="area-photo"><Picture src={constructionPhoto} alt="HMATIAS project record showing masonry and concealed technical installations" widths={[480,720,960]} sizes="(max-width:760px) 100vw,50vw" formats={["avif","webp"]} fallbackFormat="jpg" quality={88} loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption>01 · CONSTRUCTION</figcaption></figure><div class="area-body"><p class="area-kicker">BUILDING WORKS · REHABILITATION · INFRASTRUCTURE</p><h3>Construction and<br /><em>remodelling.</em></h3><p>Civil construction works and interventions in existing facilities and infrastructure.</p><ul><li>Civil construction and space remodelling</li><li>Site preparation and paving</li><li>Roofing and metal structures</li><li>Office and supporting-area interventions</li></ul><a class="area-link" href="/en/construction/">Explore Construction and Remodelling <span>↗</span></a></div></article>
        <article class="area-card"><figure class="area-photo"><Picture src={facilitiesPhoto} alt="Aluminium and glass framing in an existing facility" widths={[480,720,960]} sizes="(max-width:760px) 100vw,50vw" formats={["avif","webp"]} fallbackFormat="jpg" quality={88} loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption>02 · FACILITIES</figcaption></figure><div class="area-body"><p class="area-kicker">MAINTENANCE · CONSERVATION · OPERATIONS</p><h3>Facilities and<br /><em>maintenance.</em></h3><p>Maintenance, conservation and operational support for business and institutional facilities.</p><ul><li>Preventive and corrective maintenance</li><li>Professional cleaning and conservation</li><li>Operational support and follow-up</li><li>Localised roofing and structural interventions</li></ul><a class="area-link" href="/en/facilities/">Explore Facilities and Maintenance <span>↗</span></a></div></article>
        <article class="area-card"><figure class="area-photo"><Picture src={supplyPhoto} alt="Metal profiles for construction applications" widths={[480,720,960]} sizes="(max-width:760px) 100vw,50vw" formats={["avif","webp"]} fallbackFormat="jpg" quality={88} loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption>03 · SUPPLY & PROCUREMENT</figcaption></figure><div class="area-body"><p class="area-kicker">SOURCING · ENQUIRY · SUPPLY</p><h3>Supply and<br /><em>procurement.</em></h3><p>Sourcing and supply solutions based on the client's technical and commercial requirements.</p><ul><li>Construction materials and metal profiles</li><li>Industrial consumables and tools</li><li>PPE, workwear and equipment</li><li>Lubricants and technical fluids</li></ul><a class="area-link" href="/en/supply/">Explore Supply and Procurement <span>↗</span></a><small class="area-note">HMATIAS works on an enquiry basis. Availability, price, documentation and logistics are confirmed for each request.</small></div></article>
        <article class="area-card"><div class="area-visual" aria-hidden="true"><span class="area-visual-label">HMATIAS BUSINESS SERVICES</span><div class="area-document"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><b>DOC</b></div><div class="area-visual-tags"><span>DOCUMENTS</span><span>PROPOSALS</span><span>ORGANISATION</span></div><span class="area-visual-number">04</span></div><div class="area-body"><p class="area-kicker">DOCUMENTATION · ADMINISTRATION · BUSINESS SUPPORT</p><h3>Business<br /><em>Services.</em></h3><p>Administrative and document support for professionals and small and medium-sized businesses, with scope and deliverables agreed in advance.</p><ul><li>Institutional writing and formatting</li><li>Document management and organisation</li><li>Commercial proposals and quotations</li><li>Professional CVs and business presentations</li></ul><a class="area-link" href="/en/business-services/">Explore Business Services <span>↗</span></a></div></article>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="areas-method section-pad"><div><p class="section-kicker">03 / HOW WE WORK</p><h2>From requirement to proposal.<br /><em>Without assumptions.</em></h2></div><div class="areas-method-list"><article><span>01</span><div><h3>Understand the requirement</h3><p>We gather available information: service, specifications, quantities, location and target timing.</p></div></article><article><span>02</span><div><h3>Define the scope</h3><p>We clarify tasks, deliverables, responsibilities, resources and any mobilisation conditions.</p></div></article><article><span>03</span><div><h3>Confirm the conditions</h3><p>Price, availability, documentation, timing and logistics are confirmed for each request before a proposal is issued.</p></div></article></div></section>
    <section class="areas-contact section-pad"><div><p class="section-kicker">04 / COMMERCIAL ENQUIRIES</p><h2>Have a requirement<br /><em>to review?</em></h2><p>Identify the area, describe what you need and share the information available. The HMATIAS team will assess the request and outline the next steps.</p></div><div class="areas-contact-actions"><a class="button button-light" href={company.whatsappUri} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Contact us on WhatsApp <span>↗</span></a><a class="areas-email" href={"mailto:"+company.commercialEmail+"?subject=Business%20areas%20enquiry"}>Send an email ↗</a><a class="areas-brochure" href="/en/company-brochure/">Open the company brochure for printing ↗</a></div></section>
  </main><SiteFooter /><div class="preview-disclaimer">Independent technology preview. It does not replace or modify the official HMATIAS website.</div>
</BaseLayout>
